      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authors examined the nervous system in 12 patients with intracranial dissemination of an adolescent angiofibroma of the brain basis. It was possible to depict signs of a lesion of some cranial nerves and the brain stem as well as x-ray confirmation of a bone destruction in the brain basis. The found changes were connected with the direct influence of the angiofibroma on the above mentioned structures."},
